### DDD 事件驱动 Demo —— 手工验证脚本（IntelliJ HTTP Client / VS Code REST Client 可直接执行）
### 建议顺序：先执行「下单」，把返回的 orderId 填到下面的变量里
### 三个服务需分别启动：订单 9001、库存 9002、积分 9003

@orderHost = http://localhost:9001
@inventoryHost = http://localhost:9002
@loyaltyHost = http://localhost:9003
@redisHost = http://localhost:9004
@orderId = ORD-XXXXXXXX

### 1. 下单（总价 399 × 2 = 798）
POST {{orderHost}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "C-1001",
  "items": [
    { "productId": "P-1001", "productName": "机械键盘", "unitPrice": 399.00, "quantity": 2 }
  ]
}

### 2. 查询订单（走读模型）
GET {{orderHost}}/api/orders/{{orderId}}

### 3. 订单列表
GET {{orderHost}}/api/orders

### 4. 确认订单
POST {{orderHost}}/api/orders/{{orderId}}/confirm

### 5. 支付订单
POST {{orderHost}}/api/orders/{{orderId}}/pay
Content-Type: application/json

{ "paymentId": "PAY-20261026-001" }

### 6. 取消订单（已支付订单会被拒绝，符合不变量）
POST {{orderHost}}/api/orders/{{orderId}}/cancel
Content-Type: application/json

{ "reason": "用户改主意了" }

### 7. 事件流（审计 / 溯源）
GET {{orderHost}}/api/orders/{{orderId}}/events

### 8. 全局事件流
GET {{orderHost}}/api/diagnostics/events

### 9. 发件箱状态
GET {{orderHost}}/api/diagnostics/outbox

### 10. 手动触发 Outbox 投递
POST {{orderHost}}/api/diagnostics/outbox/flush

### 11. 读模型全量重建（清空后按事件流重放）
POST {{orderHost}}/api/diagnostics/projections/rebuild

### 12. 订单服务诊断：事件数、发件箱
GET {{orderHost}}/api/diagnostics/stats

### 13. 库存服务：余量与预占
GET {{inventoryHost}}/api/inventory/stock
GET {{inventoryHost}}/api/inventory/reserved

### 14. 积分服务：单客户积分 / 全部客户
GET {{loyaltyHost}}/api/loyalty/points/C-1001
GET {{loyaltyHost}}/api/loyalty/points

### 15. 库存不足补偿：P-1003 要 25（可用 20），订单应自动取消
POST {{orderHost}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "C-1002",
  "items": [
    { "productId": "P-1003", "productName": "显示器", "unitPrice": 1299.00, "quantity": 25 }
  ]
}

### ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
### Redis Demo（先启动 demo-redis，端口 9004）
### ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 16. 九种数据类型：目录 / 单个 / 一次跑完
GET {{redisHost}}/api/redis/types
GET {{redisHost}}/api/redis/types/zset
GET {{redisHost}}/api/redis/types/all

### 17. 限流：单次判定 / 突发 / 六种对比 / 窗口边界
GET {{redisHost}}/api/redis/ratelimit/algorithms
GET {{redisHost}}/api/redis/ratelimit/sliding_log/hit?key=user-1&limit=5&windowSeconds=10
GET {{redisHost}}/api/redis/ratelimit/sliding_log/burst?limit=5&windowSeconds=10&requests=12
GET {{redisHost}}/api/redis/ratelimit/compare?limit=5&windowSeconds=10&requests=15&intervalMillis=100
GET {{redisHost}}/api/redis/ratelimit/boundary?limit=5&windowSeconds=4

### 18. 限流：查看底层结构与清理
GET {{redisHost}}/api/redis/ratelimit/fixed_window/state?key=user-1
DELETE {{redisHost}}/api/redis/ratelimit/fixed_window/state?key=user-1

### 19. 手写锁：不续期（B 会中途拿到锁）
GET {{redisHost}}/api/redis/lock/simple?key=demo&ttlMs=1500&holdMs=3000&watchdog=false

### 20. 手写锁：看门狗续期（B 抢不到）
GET {{redisHost}}/api/redis/lock/simple?key=demo&ttlMs=1500&holdMs=4000&watchdog=true

### 21. Redisson：看门狗 / leaseTime 陷阱
GET {{redisHost}}/api/redis/lock/redisson?key=demo&holdSeconds=12
GET {{redisHost}}/api/redis/lock/redisson-lease?key=demo&leaseSeconds=3&holdSeconds=6

### 22. 并发计数：不加锁会丢更新
GET {{redisHost}}/api/redis/lock/counter?locked=false&threads=10&iterations=20
GET {{redisHost}}/api/redis/lock/counter?locked=true&threads=10&iterations=20

### 23. 查看 / 清理锁
GET {{redisHost}}/api/redis/lock/state?key=demo
DELETE {{redisHost}}/api/redis/lock?key=demo

### 24. 缓存：读 / 对照 / 更新（延迟双删）
GET {{redisHost}}/api/redis/cache/product/1
GET {{redisHost}}/api/redis/cache/product/1/inspect
PUT {{redisHost}}/api/redis/cache/product/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "机械键盘 Pro",
  "price": 399.00
}

### 25. 缓存：延迟队列状态
GET {{redisHost}}/api/redis/cache/delay/pending
GET {{redisHost}}/api/redis/cache/delay/executed

### 26. 缓存：确定性复现旧值回填
POST {{redisHost}}/api/redis/cache/race?id=99
